{
 "title": "Gaza",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Gaza",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c480",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The Second Intifada begins,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c481",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "five years of suicide bombings and military crackdowns",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c482",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "in which about a thousand Israelis",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c483",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and more than 3,000 Palestinians are killed.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c484",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Israel builds a barrier in and around the West Bank,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c485",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "which it says stops the bombers",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c486",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "which Palestinians say seizes their land.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c487",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 2005, Israel pulls all its settlers",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c488",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and soldiers out of Gaza.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c489",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Two years later, Hamas takes control of Gaza",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c490",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "after a brief civil war with its rival Fatah",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c491",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and Israel and Egypt blockade the territory.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c492",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Rockets from Gaza, Israeli air strikes on Gaza,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c493",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "wars in 2008, 12, 14 and 21.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c494",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Meanwhile in the West Bank,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c495",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Israeli settlement keeps growing.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c496",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Today about half a million Israeli settlers live there",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c497",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and roughly 200,000 more in East Jerusalem.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c498",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Most of the world considers the settlements illegal.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c499",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Israeli governments dispute that",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c500",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and many settlers see themselves",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c501",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "as returning to the biblical heartland.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c502",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Palestinians in the West Bank live under a patchwork",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c503",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "of Palestinian and Israeli control.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c504",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A two-state solution still has supporters on both sides",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c505",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "but too many it feels further away every year.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c506",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And yet in 2020 something unexpected,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c507",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the Abraham Accords, the United Arab Emirates",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c508",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and Bahrain, then Morocco and Sudan",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c509",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "normalized relations with Israel",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c510",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "without any deal for the Palestinians.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c511",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Many governments in the region have decided",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c512",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "that Iran is the bigger threat",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c513",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and that the Palestinian question can wait.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c514",
     "shot": "g_gaza",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Palestinians feel forgotten.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}